cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this framework or software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Green Software Practitioner (GSP) Certification Framework"
abstract: >-
  An audit framework for assessing how organisations adopt sustainable
  software practices. The Green Software Practitioner (GSP) certification
  defines weighted requirements across Governance & Culture, Training &
  Knowledge, Measurement & Observability, Software & Architecture Practices,
  and Continuous Improvement, aligned with the ISO/IEC TS 20125-1:2026
  lifecycle phases. The repository includes the requirements as structured
  YAML and a tool that generates scored Excel audit checklists.
